111 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am a product leader\054 educator\054 and writer with a passion for creating valuable\054 human\055centred experiences by aligning user needs with business objectives\056 With a Master of Design in Strategic Foresight and Innovation\054 I bring a unique blend of design thinking and foresight methodologies to product development\054 helping businesses stay ahead of emerging trends\056\n\nAs a Managing Design Consultant at IBM iX\054 I\047ve led cross\055functional teams to deliver large\055scale\054 complex applications in sectors such as government\054 financial services\054 parcel delivery\054 and airlines\056 In 2020\054 I co\055founded IBM\047s Strategic Foresight Guild\054 which now has over 500 members\056 Our mission is to empower roles across the development lifecycle with the skills to future\055proof their products\056\n\nIn addition to my consulting work\054 I serve as a Course Director at York University and a Professor at George Brown College\054 and I formerly taught at BrainStation\056 I\047ve mentored and taught over 400 students\054 fostering the next generation of designers and product thinkers\056\n\nAs a published writer\054 I share insights on design and product strategy through platforms such as Adobe XD Ideas\054 UX Planet\054 and IBM Design\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 112 0 R
     /Pg 101 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

